# Vasudha Neo 4B — Qwen3.5-4B post-trained with on-policy methods only
# (distillation from Qwen3.5-9B, then RL with verifiable rewards). See
# docs/NEO.md.
#
# No TEMPLATE and no SYSTEM, on purpose. Ollama's built-in Qwen3.5 renderer
# and parser reproduce the model's own chat template — native tool calls and
# thinking included — and Neo is trained to work without any particular
# system prompt, so any client that speaks the Ollama or OpenAI API can drive
# it with its own tools.
#
# Most of the training targeted the fast (non-thinking) mode:
#     ollama run vasudha-neo --think=false        API: "think": false
# Thinking mode is still there when you want it (the default).
FROM ./vasudha-neo-4b-Q4_K_M.gguf

RENDERER qwen3.5
PARSER qwen3.5

PARAMETER temperature 0.7
PARAMETER top_p 0.8
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
